# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
.nested {
  color: red;
  display: block;
  & { color: blue; }
  color: green;
  display: flex;
}

.conditional {
  color: red;
  display: block;
  @media (width > 100px) { color: blue; }
  color: green;
  display: flex;
}

.consecutive {
  & { color: blue; }
  @media (width > 100px) { color: green; }
  color: red;
  display: block;
  & { color: black; }
}

.shorthand-boundary {
  margin-top: 1px;
  display: block;
  & { color: blue; }
  margin: 2px;
  display: flex;
}

.empty-declaration {
  color: red;
  display: block;
  ;
  color: blue;
  display: flex;
}

```

